# Local development only. Wrangler reads this file for `wrangler dev` and NEVER uploads it on deploy,
# so this value cannot become the production secret by accident.
#
# It is committed on purpose and is not a secret: without it, `wrangler dev` fails closed on
# POST /room (see room-routes.ts) and neither local collaboration nor the opt-in integration suite
# would be able to start a session. Production provisions the real one with
# `wrangler secret put ROOM_TOKEN_SECRET` — see docs/deployment-guide.md.
ROOM_TOKEN_SECRET=local-dev-room-token-secret-not-used-in-production
